{"unit":10,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 10","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 10 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>A question of taste</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx250\">Thirty questions on Unit 10 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u10\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u10r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; is my favourite way to relax.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Cooking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Cook</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;m interested in &hellip; more about spices.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">learning</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to learn</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">The bread &hellip; in a wood oven.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is baked</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is baking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">This dish &hellip; in Morocco.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">was invented</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">invented</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">has invented</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r103\">Put the verb in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>make</i>) Cheese <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"is made\" data-why=\"Present passive: <b>is made</b> from milk &mdash; the doer is unimportant.\"> from milk.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>grow</i>) The tomatoes <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"were grown\" data-why=\"Past passive, plural subject: <b>were grown</b>.\"> in Spain last year.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>give up</i>) I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"gave up\" data-why=\"<b>Give up</b> + <i>-ing</i>; here the past form is <b>gave up</b>.\"> eating meat two years ago.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r104\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">The cans &hellip; to a factory every week.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">are transported</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">transport</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">After &hellip; the vegetables, add the sauce.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">frying</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fry</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">The tin &hellip; in 1810.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">was invented</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">invented</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">has invented</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"5\" data-why=\"<b>By</b> introduces the doer, not the manner: <i>The soup was cooked slowly</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">The</span> <span class=\"ew\">soup</span> <span class=\"ew\">was</span> <span class=\"ew\">cooked</span> <span class=\"ew\">by</span> <span class=\"ew\">slowly</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"<b>Give up</b> takes the <i>-ing</i> form: <i>I gave up smoking</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">gave</span> <span class=\"ew\">up</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">smoke</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Somebody serves the soup cold here.<br>The soup <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"is served cold here|is served cold\" data-why=\"The doer is unimportant, so the passive: <b>is served cold</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">They invented the tin in 1810.<br>The tin <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"was invented in 1810|was invented in 1810.\" data-why=\"Past passive: <b>was invented in 1810</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u10r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">A lemon has a very <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"sour\" data-why=\"<b>Sour</b> = having a sharp taste, like a lemon.\"> taste.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Food that is not cooked at all is <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"raw\" data-why=\"<b>Raw</b> = not cooked.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Milk usually comes in a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"carton\" data-why=\"A <b>carton</b> is a light container used for milk or juice.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Honey is usually sold in a glass <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"jar\" data-why=\"A <b>jar</b> is a glass container with a wide opening and a lid.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Check the <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"best\" data-why=\"The <b>best before</b> date shows when quality starts to fall.\"> before date on the packet.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">This curry is far too &hellip; for me.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">spicy</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">plain</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">bitter</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">The meat was in the oven far too long. It was &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">undercooked</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">overcooked</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">frozen</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">The soup is very thick &mdash; it &hellip; slowly.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">pours</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fries</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">bakes</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are containers. <b>Texture</b> is how food feels in your mouth.\"><span class=\"ew\">bottle</span> <span class=\"ew\">jar</span> <span class=\"ew\">tin</span> <span class=\"ew\">texture</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are ways of preparing food. A <b>portion</b> is an amount.\"><span class=\"ew\">bake</span> <span class=\"ew\">fry</span> <span class=\"ew\">preserve</span> <span class=\"ew\">portion</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u10r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">Excuse me, there&rsquo;s a problem &hellip; my order.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">with</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">on</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;m sorry, this &hellip; what I ordered.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">isn&rsquo;t</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">doesn&rsquo;t</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">not is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">Which is the most polite way to ask to pay?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;Bill!&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;Could we have the bill, please?&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;Give me the bill.&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;d <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"recommend\" data-why=\"<b>Recommend</b> = tell someone something is good and they should try it.\"> the fish &mdash; it was excellent.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">The only <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"downside\" data-why=\"<b>The only downside was&hellip;</b> &mdash; the balancing phrase in a review.\"> was the slow service.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u10r114\">Put the three parts of the review in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">The fish was excellent and the atmosphere was relaxed.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">We went to Kara Balyq for my sister&rsquo;s birthday.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">The only downside was the slow service. I&rsquo;d still recommend it.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}